  "details": "I think a pretty strong security solution to ripping and general theft of content within game would be adding a Shield setting that makes it so that, when toggled on No one who is not on your friends list (Or whatever approved filter you create using the current safety system), will not load your model. They won't even begin downloading it.\n\nThen, like the current shield system, the person can choose to let their model load for others with a new button.\n\nThis would help prevent Cache Ripping on a larger scale, if not make it next to impossible.",
